{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "并鄭丞相跋"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "請簡詩附"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "并跋"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "增暉亦然。但取種子上功能為\n\n別"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "假宗何曾\n言種子為體。又種子唯一。何言不同"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "攬本從末"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "攝末歸本"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "言善則簡惡。不言思熏則無濫也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文竟"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文竟"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "會正\n云。後悟以四行為體。因有錯破貴耳故也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此略舉要。其餘制聽\n止作。鈔．疏備矣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "能持犯體"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "所持犯體"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如今之事法是也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如上境義"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "但破二記。其餘可知"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "當如亦不放根本也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "已上彼文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如不曉初識是人．返\n疑夷是殘等"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如迷人為杌木．迷夷為殘等"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "準此三節。即不論學．不學人。但約迷忘。根本．枝條俱放也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "若據此文。似不學人迷忘中。唯放根\n本。不放二十四枝條罪。故曰。今所分者。為結枝條有無耳"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二持中。全不用餘二門。但用上半三句。以有根\n本．方便罪故。下半三句。亦非用也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "增輝如此"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即同學人放也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此正明不學人犯結也。為不學人迷事愚犯。故犯上結十二不學無知罪。\n此十二罪望不至根本。得名止持。諸記指為古承也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此決難應先難云。犯既結罪。事何開邪。將文答之。謂事是對境\n起迷。緣而不了故。事上根條俱放。故曰聖不制罪也。若據戒疏接云。罪是可學。若有迷者。皆結其罪。當知今但\n出事放所以也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此問上想疑二字。意謂若云。想疑忘生事上根條俱放者。何故律中境想有犯．\n不犯邪。答。緣罪有無故也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此亦遮疑。應先難云。此中疑及不識事放犯結。如何前九句疑及不\n識事犯皆制罪。以文答之。謂前明白可學故結。此是迷忘不可學故開。故不同也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "若爾。領上辭。謂若云。不可學人緣事不了放根條者。後作持門中緣法亦有想轉。亦\n不犯殘。後既同此。亦合事故。根條犯上結十二罪。未知至後作持中。若為制邪。徵意如此。宜細詳之。此徵凡有\n二意。一雖論作持。意在决通後三門也。故下。並指如前段後九句是也。二暗破古義。以古人作持不通不可學。\n故此徵之。答中指後。後復指前。貴在作持有不可學。異於古人之義也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂此約事論法如後說。故曰。更為辨也。二記指作順古答。已上是今所解。若準二記解釋\n今非。如下節為六段辨之也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "應知作今師義解也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "今師確執。不足語也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "學．不學人俱放。彼以惡事不可學作故也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "不學結學人放也。已上彼文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "彼云兩序。如下引破"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "古科但據下卷前十一篇。\n如後所破"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三請"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三說"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三結已。云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此出勝鬘經。說已稱三寶名釋迦佛云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "次當說罪求悔"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "同聲念佛。或懺違逆父母．師長。其文如後"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三請。或一請。觀時延促。下同"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "既請師已。即須從師乞戒。乞云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三乞"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答。能"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答。能"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答。能"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答。能"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答。能"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答。能"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答。能"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答。能"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答。無"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答。無"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答。無"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答。無"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答。無"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答。無"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答。無"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答。能"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答。能"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答。能"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答。能"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答。能"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答。能"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答。能"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答。能"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答。能"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答。能"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答。能"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答。能"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答。能"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答。能"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如為出家五眾受戒。當用此文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "依金光明經．淨名經錄出"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "次第十科。其間䇿導教誡引用因緣。當隨機利鈍開解為先。至於臨\n\n事不必一定。今且作一途出法"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "有至梵音義字即誦。非也。梵音本為止息喧亂故"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "凡白眾之語。直述其事。今時四六偶對。或祝贊皇風。或褒\n揚王道。有同伶倫俳說無異。致令聽者。都無所曉。弊風久矣。宜須革之"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "當處即云\n當寺．當院"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "進納應云。\n克勤給侍。悅可眾心"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "若準律中例須單白。今時乍投出家。或有作者。故為出之。當如上敘白。至乞求剃髮已。接云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答云。僧已集"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答云。和合"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答云。此眾無未受具戒者"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答云。此無說欲及清淨者"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答云。剃髮和僧單白羯磨。白云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "牒行者名"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "牒和尚名"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "問云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答。成"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "教授座主。今時\n謂之引請人。即從座起。至眾前合掌揖僧竟。即出眾去"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "引請者云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "請詞云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "連唱三徧。亦不須云\n再請。慇勤三請等。出自流俗"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "引請者云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "詞云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三請"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "引請者教行者\n逐句隨聲唱之。偈云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "亦不須呼萬歲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "律中\n但辭父母。今時先拜國王。義須依準"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如是隨機勸誘。臨時自述。不必誦語"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以指滴少許於頂上"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此偈闍梨直聲自說。有令引請者說。或行者隨和皆非"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "亦逐句隨聲說"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "有令合眾同誦亦得"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或再誦出家唄亦得"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此偈和尚自說。不須隨和"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "律鈔至披袈裟已。即令說偈禮散。今多為授翻邪三皈。隨\n為出之"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如是種種。隨機開導已。云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三說已。又加三結。云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "逐句隨說"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或恐事繁。且待眾散拜賀亦得"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "律無此科。今時所行"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或誦。尊常開請奉福上界天龍八部等文。此出智者法華懺儀。其可準用。今時\n亦多念對偶文章。全非迴向祝贊之意。今並改正。莫同浮俗"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "元照"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "標心期受。須識何法"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "已知戒法。受必藉緣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "諸緣雖具。須明境徧"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "律鈔明三品心。中下二品得戒非勝。今須直求\n上品。故委示之"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "言略事廣。下為略釋"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一攝律儀戒。二攝善法戒。三攝眾生戒"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一空解脫門。二無相解脫門。三無作解脫門"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一法身。二報身。三應身"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上總列名。下別配釋"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "心境相應。納體正要"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "律鈔云。應沙彌時。教令列名。顯數識相誦之。若\n不明識。受戒不成"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答云。無。謂曾受佛戒已。犯於四重。即是佛海邊收之人。從喻為\n名"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答。無"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答。無。謂白衣．沙\n彌時。盜聽大僧說戒．羯磨法也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答。無。謂先捨外道來受佛戒後。復歸邪。令重來受也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答。無。一天生。二揵作。即刀去陰根者。三因見他婬。妬心婬起。四忽然變作。\n五半月能婬。半月不能婬"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答。無。次至第十。即五逆也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答。無"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答。無"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答。無。謂立邪三寶。破佛正法。令僧異見。不得道益"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答。無。上二難。佛世則有。末代所無"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答。無"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答。無"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答。無。謂身挾二根。僧尼不攝故"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "衣鉢．父母各二。并五病。成十六。今合為十"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "稱己名云。某甲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "稱壇上和尚兩字名云。某甲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答云。已滿"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答云。具足"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "父母存。則答云。聽。父\n母亡。則答云。無父母"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答。無。準鈔縱有。亦不遮受"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答。無"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答。無"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答云。\n是。謂年二十。能耐寒．熱．飢．渴．風．雨．毒蟲．能忍惡言．能一食．持戒等。是丈夫相"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答。無。鈔云。上四應得。狂中若全不覺好惡。不得"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "元照"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "元照"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "清之"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "請簡．謝詩附"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此二者不出娑婆"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "熾然者。猛盛也。求生。即能觀心。淨土。即所觀依正。皆緣生\n\n法。此則能所俱空。即為無生也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "彼文第二疑甚詳。請細看之"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "元照再白"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "法明"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "仁岳"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "守仁"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "允堪"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "已上引列諸家。自下歷考\n得失"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "已上斥其妄立。自下責其遺漏"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "已上敘立。自下\n引證"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "已上舉例證。自下引文證"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "行事鈔．戒\n疏．內典錄文亦同此"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "附光師傳"}
